AUDIO_DSP is a mixed-license collection. There is no single license covering
every file. The applicable license is determined by the file header and the
boundaries below.

1. The existing top-level aud_*.c and aud_*.h modules are C ports derived from
   DaisySP and retain their MIT license notices.

2. Mutable Instruments STM32 algorithm sources under
   eurorack_algorithms/vendor/{braids,clouds,elements,frames,marbles,peaks,
   plaits,rings,stages,streams,tides,tides2,warps,yarns,stmlib,
   stm_audio_bootloader} are distributed
   under the MIT License unless an individual file says otherwise. The C ABI
   wrappers and examples for these modules are also distributed under MIT.

3. Branches, Edges, Grids, their AVR compatibility support, and their C ABI
   wrappers are distributed under GPL-3.0-or-later. Linking these components
   into firmware makes the resulting combined work subject to the GPL terms.
   Applications that cannot satisfy GPL distribution requirements must omit
   these three modules and their objects.

4. Mutable Instruments hardware design files were not copied into this
   repository. The upstream hardware license therefore does not apply to the
   files distributed here.

Full standard license texts are in LICENSES/MIT.txt and
LICENSES/GPL-3.0-or-later.txt. Copyright notices in source files must be kept.

Mutable Instruments and individual module names may be trademarks of their
respective owners. This is an independent software port, not an official
Mutable Instruments product.
